  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-023-jin043-liuchang:ren" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-023-jin043-liuchang:ren:m0000" ref="z4k_st6_6zf">劉公榮</persName>與人飲酒，雜穢非類，人或譏之。</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-023-jin043-liuchang:pu" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-023-jin043-liuchang:pu:m0000" ref="z4k_st6_6zf">昶</persName>字<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-023-jin043-liuchang:pu:m0002" ref="z4k_st6_6zf">公榮</persName>，沛國人。</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-023-jin043-liuchang:chunqiu" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-023-jin043-liuchang:chunqiu:m0000" ref="z4k_st6_6zf">昶</persName>為人通達，仕至兗州刺史。</p>
